label "Memory and context poisoning defense diagram"
box src 16 40 100 44 "untrusted|sources"
box self 16 130 100 44 "agent's own|outputs"
box gate 170 78 110 60 "write gate|scan, attribute" acc
box mem 330 40 110 44 "memory store|segmented"
box ret 330 130 110 44 "retrieval"
arrow src gate
arrow self gate dashed
arrow gate mem
arrow mem ret
text 385 200 "unverified entries expire" size=11
note "treat every memory write as untrusted"
